image test is load from "analysis.pgm"
number width is columns of test
number height is rows of test
number pixel_count is count pixel 255 in test

boolean has_white is any pixel test .== 255
boolean all_black is all pixel test .<= 50

output "Image dimensions: " + string(width) + "x" + string(height)
output "White pixels: " + string(pixel_count)